{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"605ad2afe89e9d005df75cab9fdf0889a028c6fcf6d0c9964dfb3efaddba0026","digest":{"component_or_area":"test infrastructure / git fixture setup","key_entities":["tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_copy_repoints_sibling_origin_and_keeps_refs_isolated","tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py","_BARE_REMOTE_UPKEEP_PINS","tests/_topology_template.py","receive.autogc","gc.autoDetach","maintenance.autoDetach","GIT_TRACE2_EVENT","shutil.copytree","git maintenance run --auto --quiet --detach","tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_fixture_bare_remote_leaves_no_detached_upkeep_behind_a_push"],"problem_keywords":["flaky test","race condition","git auto-maintenance","detached background process","concurrent mutation","copytree","objects/maintenance.lock"],"propositions":["A bare git repository created with `git init --bare` and pushed into by a test fixture spawns a detached `git maintenance run` background process that outlives the push command, allowing concurrent mutation of the object database.","The subsequent `shutil.copytree` operation fails mid-walk because git maintenance is concurrently repacking loose-object fanout directories, not just holding `objects/maintenance.lock`.","The test fixture bare remote must pin `receive.autogc=false`, `gc.autoDetach=false`, and `maintenance.autoDetach=false` before any push to eliminate the concurrent mutator entirely.","A new guard test must assert the absence of detached background upkeep by inspecting `GIT_TRACE2_EVENT` trace output, with a `receive-pack` positive control to prevent vacuous passing."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787318195942544001,"uuid":"1a99fd4c-789a-435c-b7d0-c07fca9ac4b4"}